+ * AOT file, vouching that its code carries the loop-header terminate check
+ * (aot_compile_check_terminate). The loader ignores the field; the embedder
+ * (Hull: include/hull/cap/wasm_aot_stamp.h) refuses AOT code without it. High
+ * 32 bits "HULL", low 32 bits the stamp version - bump it in both places when
+ * the contract changes. */
